OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged after man hurt in
OL,4,ABirmingham disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged after
OL,7,Fdisorder broke out in Birmingham,
OL,8,Fleaving one man with a broken leg.
OL,10,FA pedestrian, a man in his 30s, was
OL,11,Ftaken to hospital after being hit by a
OL,12,Fvan during the unrest on Mayfield Road,
OL,13,Fjust off Pershore Road, in Stirchley,
OL,14,Fon 14 May.
OL,16,FMark Keating, 49, from Tamworth has
OL,17,Fbeen charged with four counts of
OL,18,Fassault by beating, West Midlands
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
