OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged after man hurt in
OL,4,ABirmingham disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyan Bridge, 45, from Bromsgrove,
OL,7,FWorcestershire, is accused of two
OL,8,Fcounts of using threatening or abusive
OL,9,Fwords or behaviour likely to cause
OL,10,Fharassment, alarm or distress.
